  "id": 169,
  "Specification": "Simplified specification of Leslie Lamport's Fast Paxos protocol with a unique coordinator (Phase 1 omitted), all-to-all communication, and stable storage. The coordinator may start a fast round (FastAny/FastPropose/FastDecide using FastQuorums of size at least 3/4 of replicas) and may fall back to a classic round (ClassicAccept/ClassicAccepted/ClassicDecide) on collision. FastNontriviality asserts that only proposed values can be learnt.",
