  "DivisionNotes": [
    "TemporalNesting is true: SF_<<...>>(...) expands to []<>(ENABLED ... ) => []<>... so contains nested temporal operators in FastSpec.",
    "Action operators FastAny, FastPropose, FastDecide, ClassicAccept, ClassicAccepted, ClassicDecide, FastNext are placed in ActionDefNames per the partition rule and excluded from the four OperatorDefNames buckets.",
    "FastAssume is a Boolean conjunction (state-level predicate) used in ASSUME, hence StatePredicate.",
    "IsMajorityValue and FastNontriviality are Boolean-valued non-temporal predicates, hence StatePredicate.",
    "FastTypeOK is a type invariant, hence StatePredicate. FastInit is the initial-state predicate."
  ]
